OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe a mixture of clear intervals and
OL,7,Foccasional showers, the showers will
OL,8,Fbe frequent and heavy at times.
OL,9,FOccasionally fresh westerly or
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FAnother day of sunny
OL,13,Fintervals and heavy showers, however
OL,14,Fthe showers are expected to become
OL,15,Fless frequent by evening. Light to
OL,16,Fmoderate westerly wind veering
OL,17,Fnorthwesterly later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
