OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Ffew early showers Thursday then dry
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells. Overnight rain
OL,8,Fclears early Friday, the rest of
OL,9,FFriday and Saturday see sunny spells
OL,10,Fand frequent heavy, blustery showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
